  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Flightsuits provide the perfect combination of strength and style. Our military-styled flight suit features a high-quality cotton / polyester fabric blend, offering a comfortable and authentic feel.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "23652",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Flightsuits provide the perfect combination of strength and style. Our military-styled flight suit features a high-quality cotton / polyester fabric blend, offering a comfortable and authentic feel. High-Capacity Storage: The combat pilot coveralls come equipped with 2 zippered slash chest pockets, zippered utility pocket with pen holder on the left sleeve, 4 zippered leg storage pockets, and 1 snap-button accessory pouch for carrying gear, props, and essentials. Perfect Fit: These military jumpsuits feature a two-way front zipper closure, adjustable waist tabs, hook &amp; loop wrist cuffs, and bottom leg zippers for a perfect fit and easy wear. Utility at the Forefront: Customize your flight suit costume with a hook &amp; loop badge holder and the left chest loop field, allowing you to add name tape, flags, and morale patches. The aviation jumpsuit features reinforced shoulders for durability. Great for Costumes: From Halloween nights to themed parties, our Air-Force style flighsuits provide an authentic aviator look that&rsquo;s accompanied by all-day comfort.</p>",
